      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC UI will send 3ms for scan window and interval for old UI + new floss, see [1]. That might be worse than the prior 100% scan cycle.\nIf it isn\u0027t, or if we don\u0027t care of that combination, then LGTM.\n\n[1] https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:device/bluetooth/floss/floss_lescan_client.cc;l\u003d209;drc\u003d3ed9cf1119782c06147dac3bf548d5a1f7ee9336",
